                    "frequency": "High",
                    "semantic_group_id": "excessive consumption",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "I went on a weekend <w>binge</w> and finished three entire seasons of that new sci-fi show.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Я устроил себе <w>марафон</w> на выходных и посмотрел целиком три сезона того нового научно-фантастического сериала."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "A weekend <w>binge</w> of your favorite show can be a great way to relax and disconnect.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
